      "date": "2026-02-07T21:16:34.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹68.06 (vs ₹42.78 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹68.06 (up from ₹42.78 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹37.3b (up 6.4% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.18b (up 59% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.9% (up from 3.9% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 17% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 2% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
